00:28:10.574 --> 00:28:14.850
I think the problem or the question

00:28:14.850 --> 00:28:17.370
or really for the next step

00:28:17.370 --> 00:28:20.020
is that's been siloed on our side

00:28:21.120 --> 00:28:24.753
and somewhat siloed I
think in the academy.

00:28:25.830 --> 00:28:29.220
And so finding concrete,

00:28:29.220 --> 00:28:31.590
and you told me this, I
think the first time we met,

00:28:31.590 --> 00:28:34.830
which I think was, it helped
me frame some of my thinking.

00:28:34.830 --> 00:28:37.140
It's one thing to talk in the abstract,

