00:34:41.070 --> 00:34:44.130
et cetera to this discussion?

00:34:44.130 --> 00:34:45.780
- I definitely think you do.

00:34:45.780 --> 00:34:48.600
And that's something I
would like to be a part of

00:34:48.600 --> 00:34:51.273
and hope, you know, I can
help in any small way.

00:34:53.312 --> 00:34:55.050
But I think, and again
going back to what you said,

00:34:55.050 --> 00:34:56.970
and this we need to spend more time,

00:34:56.970 --> 00:35:00.660
on the concrete activity
between departments.

00:35:00.660 --> 00:35:03.090
I think we'll have lots of
great discussion, right?

00:35:03.090 --> 00:35:05.100
The beauty of this place, it could convene

00:35:05.100 --> 00:35:07.829
and you can do things
