00:36:08.820 --> 00:36:10.489
And that was the point.

00:36:10.489 --> 00:36:12.390
So I think the law school, the health,

00:36:12.390 --> 00:36:15.570
like can we come up with a vocabulary

00:36:15.570 --> 00:36:18.060
