scientific, you know, laws.

00:36:28.710 --> 00:36:31.350
To me that's the work that has to be done.

00:36:31.350 --> 00:36:33.330
And so instead of just talking about it,

00:36:33.330 --> 00:36:35.880
can we pick these domains
and say we're gonna,

