00:36:56.910 --> 00:36:59.172
So there's almost like
a vocabulary, I mean,

00:36:59.172 --> 00:37:00.393
which I think the
academy's good at, right?

00:37:00.393 --> 00:37:01.531
- Right.

00:37:01.531 --> 00:37:04.230
- Like this is the whole scientific,

00:37:04.230 --> 00:37:05.328
you're sort of genus and species.

00:37:05.328 --> 00:37:06.283
That's what we're talking about.

00:37:06.283 --> 00:37:08.760
- And I mean we've had a
couple of conversations

00:37:08.760 --> 00:37:12.510
